1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,900
And-and the worst part is

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:05,541
that they kicked me out
and let Stuart stay.

3
00:00:05,538 --> 00:00:08,168
(Amy:)I understand, but this is
a special day for them.

4
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:10,304
(Amy:)Can you just try and let it go?

5
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,640
(Sheldon:)She's right.

6
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:14,844
(Sheldon:)You know, I just learned Amy
went to a theme park without me,

7
00:00:14,848 --> 00:00:16,718
(Sheldon:)but I'm not going
to ruin her birthday.

8
00:00:16,716 --> 00:00:19,516
(Sheldon:)I'll wait, and ruin
24 individual hours

9
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:21,819
(Sheldon:)sprinkled
throughout the year.

10
00:00:23,957 --> 00:00:25,727
(Sheldon:)Boop.

11
00:00:29,395 --> 00:00:32,535
(Howard:)Deep breaths,
slow breaths.

12
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:35,702
(Bernadette:)I'm so thirsty.
Give me more ice chips.

13
00:00:40,807 --> 00:00:44,677
(Stuart:)Sorry. I... thought
these were room ice chips.

14
00:00:45,912 --> 00:00:47,912
(Stuart:)I'll go get some more.

15
00:00:47,914 --> 00:00:49,784
(Howard:)Uh, Stuart, while
you're out there,

16
00:00:49,783 --> 00:00:51,553
(Howard:)don't come back.

17
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:55,021
(Howard:)Okay.

